'''Linnea''' (Japanese: '''アサミ''' ''Asami'') is a {{tc|Furisode Girl}} from the [[Laverre Gym]]. In {{aniseries|PTS}}, she is a recurring character who first appeared in ''[[XY073|A Fashionable Battle!]]''.

==In animation==
===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|XY}}====
Linnea is a {{tc|Furisode Girl}} loyal to [[Laverre City]] [[Gym Leader]] [[Valerie]]. When [[Sawyer]] came to Laverre City to ask for a [[Gym]] {{pkmn|battle}}, Linnea told him that Valerie wasn't available at the moment due to her collection being displayed in a fashion show. During the fashion show, Linnea picked Sawyer from the audience to battle against Valerie in an official Gym battle that was part of the show.

Linnea reappeared in ''[[XY074|Fairy-Type Trickery!]]'', where she was following {{Ash}} and Valerie's Gym battle.

She reappeared in a flashback in ''[[XY140|Till We Compete Again!]]''.

